The NSA web site (www.nsa.gov) including the SELinux web site
(www.nsa.gov/selinux) will be taken offline for scheduled maintenance
beginning at 5:00pm EST on Friday, 4 February.  The site should again be
available by 6:00am EST on Monday, 7 February.  The SELinux mailing list
is not expected to be affected.

